 text-content-secondary">Product Owner at GoodBuy Gear</div></div></div><a class="relative inline-flex w-fit max-w-full appearance-none items-center justify-center overflow-hidden truncate text-center outline-none transition-all duration-200 focus-visible:misc-border-size-focus-ring disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:cursor-not-allowed bg-background-default text-content-white-primary-inverted hover:bg-background-hover focus-visible:bg-background-hover focus-visible:ring-accent-alpha-5 active:bg-background-down rounded-500 disabled:opacity-30" aria-busy="false" data-translation-key="09c6ec4f-f61f-4849-8199-c2ec8c134686" href="https://www.photoroom.com/customer-stories/goodbuygear"><div class="relative flex max-w-full items-center justify-center content-to-edge-spacious-px-600 size-h-600"><span class="max-w-full truncate component-500">Hikayeyi oku</span></div></a></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="flex flex-col w-full min-w-0 overflow-hidden rounded-area-500 @container bg-[var(--customer-story-card-background-color)]" style="--customer-story-card-background-color:#E5F9FF" data-translation-key="2825a3de-ec4b-425d-bd67-23748302230b"><div class="relative grow [--visual-height:224px] @[384px]:[--visual-height:256px]"><div class="relative grid transition-all grid-rows-[var(--visual-height)_1fr] @[960px]:grid-flow-col @[960px]:grid-cols-2 @[960px]:grid-rows-1 h-full @[960px]:min-h-[480px]"><div class="relative @[960px]:order-2"><div class="absolute inset-0 flex @[960px]:flex-col [&amp;_img]:block [&amp;_img]:h-full [&amp;_img]:w-full [&amp;_img]:object-cover [&amp;_img]:object-top [--gradient-direction:to_top] @[960px]:[--gradient-direction:to_right]" style="mask-image:linear-gradient(var(--gradient-direction),                      rgba(255, 0, 0, 0.00) 0%,                      rgba(255, 0, 0, 0.01) 4.5%,                      rgba(255, 0, 0, 0.03) 9%,                      rgba(255, 0, 0, 0.06) 12.5%,                      rgba(255, 0, 0, 0.10) 15.5%,        