;_p_code]:px-1.5 [&amp;_p_code]:align-middle [&amp;_p_code]:text-600 [&amp;_p_code]:font-500 [&amp;_p_code]:before:[content:&#39;&#39;] [&amp;_p_code]:after:[content:&#39;&#39;] [&amp;_blockquote]:[quotes:none] [&amp;_blockquote_p]:before:[content:&#39;&#39;] [&amp;_blockquote_p]:after:[content:&#39;&#39;] [&amp;_ul]:mt-3 [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:pl-4 [&amp;_.inline-next-element+*]:inline [&amp;_li_+_li]:pt-2 [&amp;&gt;div&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0"><div><p>Bir görsel yüklediğinde, Photoroom’un yapay zeka destekli arka plan kaldırıcı aracı, görselindeki ana nesneyi (ürün, kişi veya obje) algılar ve izole eder, ardından arka plandan ayırıp siler.</p></div></span></div></div></div></article><article><div class="group/faq-question flex cursor-pointer flex-row items-start justify-between gap-4 py-4 outline-none sm:py-6" role="button" aria-controls="faq-answer-_R_taj7m6_"><h4 class="heading-light-400 pt-[5px] [word-break:break-word] sm:heading-light-500 sm:pt-[3px]">Bir görselin arka planını kalite kaybı olmadan kaldırabilir miyim?</h4><button type="button" class="relative inline-flex max-w-full appearance-none items-center justify-center overflow-hidden truncate text-center outline-none duration-200 focus-visible:misc-border-size-focus-ring disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:cursor-not-allowed bg-background-subdued text-content-primary hover:bg-background-subdued-hover focus-visible:bg-background-subdued-hover focus-visible:ring-accent-alpha-5 active:bg-background-subdued-down rounded-500 disabled:opacity-30 h-8 w-8 shrink-0 rounded-full transition-all group-hover/faq-question:bg-background-subdued-hover" aria-busy="false"><div role="presentation" aria-hidden="true" class="flex items-center justify-center size-500"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" style="flex-shrink:0" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-size-500"><path d="M19 11H13V5C13 4.73478 12.8946 4.48043 12.7071 4.29289C12.5196 4.10536 12.2652 4 12 4C11.7348 4 11.4804 4.10536 11.2929 4.29289C11.1054 4.48043 11 4.73478 11 5V11H5C4.73478 11 4.48043 11.1054 4.29289 11.2929C4.10536 11.4804 4 11.7348 4 12C4 12.2652 4.10536 12.5196 4.29289 12.7071C4.48043 12.8946 4.73478 13 5 13H11V19C11 19.2652 11.1054 19.5196 11.2929 19.7071C11.4804 19.8946 11.7348 20 12 20C12.2652 20 12.5196 19.8946 12.7071 19.7071C12.8946 19.5196 13 19.2652 13 19V13H19C19.2652 13 19.5196 12.8946 19.7071 12.7071C19.8946 12.5196 20 12.2652 20 12C20 11.7348 19.8946 11.4804 19.7071 11.2929C19.5196 11.1054 19.2652 11 19 11Z"></path></svg></div></button></div><div id="faq-answer-_R_taj7m6_" aria-expanded="false" class="grid transition-all duration-200 ease-in-out grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0"><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="body-600 pb-6 text-content-secondary sm:pb-8"><span class="[&amp;_*]:[word-break:break-word] [&amp;_*[id]]:scroll-mt-20 [&amp;_a[href]]:text-current [&amp;_a[href]]:underline [&amp;_a:not([href])]:!no-underline [&amp;_b]:font-500 [&amp;_strong]:font-500 [&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_code]:break-all [&amp;_p_code]:inline-block [&amp;_p_code]:rounded-400 [&amp;_p_code]:bg-background-subdued [&amp;_p_code]:px-1.5 [&amp;_p_code]:align-middle [&amp;_p_code]:text-600 [&amp;_p_code]:font-500 [&amp;_p_code]:before:[content:&#39;&#39;] [&amp;_p_code]:after:[content:&#39;&#39;] [&amp;_blockquote]:[quotes:none] [&amp;_blockquote_p]:before:[content:&#39;&#39;] [&amp;_blockquote_p]:after:[content:&#39;&#39;] [&amp;_ul]:mt-3 [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:pl-4 [&amp;_.inline-next-element+*]:inline [&amp;_li_+_li]:pt-2 [&amp;&gt;div&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0"><div><p>Photoroom ile herhangi bir görselin Arka planını kaldırırken tüm detayları koruyabilirsin. Yapay zeka destekli Arka plan kaldırıcı, görselin çözünürlüğünü, keskinliğini ve kenar hassasiyetini korur; böylece ürünün veya konun net ve doğal kalır.</p></div></span></div></div></div></article><article><div class="group/faq-question flex cursor-pointer flex-row items-start justify-between gap-4 py-4 outline-none sm:py-6" role="button" aria-controls="faq-answer-_R_15aj7m6_"><h4 class="heading-light-400 pt-[5px] [word-break:break-word] sm:heading-light-500 sm:pt-[3px]">Arka plan kaldırma aracı ücretsiz mi?</h4><button type="button" class="relative inline-flex max-w-full appearance-none items-center justify-center overflow-hidden truncate text-center outline-none duration-200 focus-visible:misc-border-size-focus-ring disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:cursor-not-allowed bg-background-subdued text-content-primary hover:bg-background-subdued-hover focus-visible:bg-background-subdued-hover focus-visible:ring-accent-alpha-5 active:bg-background-subdued-down rounded-500 disabled:opacity-30 h-8 w-8 shrink-0 rounded-full transition-all group-hover/faq-question:bg-background-subdued-hover" aria-busy="false"><div role="presentation" aria-hidden="true" class="flex items-center justify-center size-500"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" style="flex-shrink:0" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-size-500"><path d="M19 11H13V5C13 4.73478 12.8946 4.48043 12.7071 4.29289C12.5196 4.10536 12.2652 4 12 4C11.7348 4 11.4804 4.10536 11.2929 4.29289C11.1054 4.48043 11 4.73478 11 5V11H5C4.73478 11 4.48043 11.1054 4.29289 11.2929C4.10536 11.4804 4 11.7348 4 12C4 12.2652 4.10536 12.5196 4.29289 12.7071C4.48043 12.8946 4.73478 13 5 13H11V19C11 19.2652 11.1054 19.5196 11.2929 19.7071C11.4804 19.8946 11.7348 20 12 20C12.2652 20 12.5196 19.8946 12.7071 19.7071C12.8946 19.5196 13 19.2652 13 19V13H19C19.2652 13 19.5196 12.8946 19.7071 12.7071C19.8946 12.5196 20 12.2652 20 12C20 11.7348 19.8946 11.4804 19.7071 11.2929C19.5196 11.1054 19.2652 11 19 11Z"></path></svg></div></button></div><div id="faq-answer-_R_15aj7m6_" aria-expanded="false" class="grid transition-all duration-200 ease-in-out grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0"><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="body-600 pb-6 text-content-secondary sm:pb-8"><span class="[&amp;_*]:[word-break:break-word] [&amp;_*[id]]:scroll-mt-20 [&amp;_a[href]]:text-current [&amp;_a[href]]:underline [&amp;_a:not([href])]:!no-underline [&amp;_b]:font-500 [&amp;_strong]:font-500 [&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_code]:break-all [&amp;_p_code]:inline-block [&amp;_p_code]:rounded-400 [&amp;_p_code]:bg-background-subdued [&amp;_p_code]:px-1.5 [&amp;_p_code]:align-middle [&amp;_p_code]:text-600 [&amp;_p_code]:font-500 [&amp;_p_code]:before:[content:&#39;&#39;] [&amp;_p_code]:after:[content:&#39;&#39;] [&amp;_blockquote]:[quotes:none] [&amp;_blockquote_p]:before:[content:&#39;&#39;] [&amp;_blockquote_p]:after:[content:&#39;&#39;] [&amp;_ul]:mt-3 [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:pl-4 [&amp;_.inline-next-element+*]:inline [&amp;_li_+_li]:pt-2 [&amp;&gt;div&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0"><div><p>Photoroom mobilde ve masaüstünde kullanılabilir.<a href="https://www.photoroom.com/across-devices">Mobilde ve masaüstünde</a> hemen ücretsiz başlayıp arka planları kaldırabilirsin. Hazır olduğunda, <a href="https://www.photoroom.com/tr/pricing">daha fazla</a> YZ fotoğraf düzenleme aracına ve yüksek çözünürlüklü dışa aktarmalara erişmek için yükseltebilirsin.</p></div></span></div></div></div></article><article><div class="group/faq-question flex cursor-pointer flex-row items-start justify-between gap-4 py-4 outline-none sm:py-6" role="button" aria-controls="faq-answer-_R_1daj7m6_"><h4 class="heading-light-400 pt-[5px] [word-break:break-word] sm:heading-light-500 sm:pt-[3px]">Arka planı otomatik olarak nasıl kaldırıp yenisiyle değiştirebilirim?</h4><button type="button" class="relative inline-flex max-w-full appearance-none items-center justify-center overflow-hidden truncate text-center outline-none duration-200 focus-visible:misc-border-size-focus-ring disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:cursor-not-allowed bg-background-subdued text-content-primary hover:bg-background-subdued-hover focus-visible:bg-background-subdued-hover focus-visible:ring-accent-alpha-5 active:bg-background-subdued-down rounded-500 disabled:opacity-30 h-8 w-8 shrink-0 rounded-full transition-all group-hover/faq-question:bg-background-subdued-hover" aria-busy="false"><div role="presentation" aria-hidden="true" class="flex items-center justify-center size-500"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" style="flex-shrink:0" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-size-500"><path d="M19 11H13V5C13 4.73478 12.8946 4.48043 12.7071 4.29289C12.5196 4.10536 12.2652 4 12 4C11.7348 4 11.4804 4.10536 11.2929 4.29289C11.1054 4.48043 11 4.73478 11 5V11H5C4.73478 11 4.48043 11.1054 4.29289 11.2929C4.10536 11.4804 4 11.7348 4 12C4 12.2652 4.10536 12.5196 4.29289 12.7071C4.48043 12.8946 4.73478 13 5 13H11V19C11 19.2652 11.1054 19.5196 11.2929 19.7071C11.4804 19.8946 11.7348 20 12 20C12.2652 20 12.5196 19.8946 12.7071 19.7071C12.8946 19.5196 13 19.2652 13 19V13H19C19.2652 13 19.5196 12.8946 19.7071 12.7071C19.8946 12.5196 20 12.2652 20 12C20 11.7348 19.8946 11.4804 19.7071 11.2929C19.5196 11.1054 19.2652 11 19 11Z"></path></svg></div></button></div><div id="faq-answer-_R_1daj7m6_" aria-expanded="false" class="grid transition-all duration-200 ease-in-out grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0"><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="body-600 pb-6 text-content-secondary sm:pb-8"><span class="[&amp;_*]:[word-break:break-word] [&amp;_*[id]]:scroll-mt-20 [&amp;_a[href]]:text-current [&amp;_a[href]]:underline [&amp;_a:not([href])]:!no-underline [&amp;_b]:font-500 [&amp;_strong]:font-500 [&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_code]:break-all [&amp;_p_code]:inline-block [&amp;_p_code]:rounded-400 [&amp;_p_code]:bg-background-subdued [&amp;_p_code]:px-1.5 [&amp;_p_code]:align-middle [&amp;_p_code]:text-600 [&amp;_p_code]:font-500 [&amp;_p_code]:before:[content:&#39;&#39;] [&amp;_p_code]:after:[content:&#39;&#39;] [&amp;_blockquote]:[quotes:none] [&amp;_blockquote_p]:before:[content:&#39;&#39;] [&amp;_blockquote_p]:after:[content:&#39;&#39;] [&amp;_ul]:mt-3 [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:pl-4 [&amp;_.inline-next-element+*]:inline [&amp;_li_+_li]:pt-2 [&amp;&gt;div&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0"><div><p>Fotoğrafını Photoroom'a yükle, yapay zeka destekli arka plan kaldırıcı arka planı otomatik olarak silsin. Arka planı şeffaf bırakabilir ya da profesyonel bir studio ortamı, <a href="https://www.photoroom.com/tr/ai-product-photography/lifestyle">lifestyle</a> sahnesi veya <a href="https://www.photoroom.com/tr/tools/instant-backgrounds">YZ Arka Planlar</a> <strong>ile özel bir arka planla değiştir.</strong></p></div></span></div></div></div></article></div></div></section></main><div data-aria-hidden="true" aria-hidden="true"><div data-translation-key="b27bb72e-1c4e-4c9c-8a7d-4719ecfc9327" class=""><div role="none" class="relative mx-auto overflow-hidden flex flex-col items-center justify-center px-4 py-10 sm:px-10 min-h-[440px] sm:min-h-[480px] lg:min-h-[640px] [background:linear-gradient(180deg,#010518_0%,#041031_15.16%,#12346B_40.38%,#265B9E_57.21%,#81B7E6_83.17%,#E7F7FF_100%)]"><div class="relative z-10 mx-auto w-full @container flex flex-col items-center text-center max-w-[800px]"><h3 class="heading-light-800 mb-4 text-balance sm:heading-light-900 lg:heading-light-1000 text-content-white-primary">Daha iyi ürün görsellerini daha hızlı oluşturmaya hazır mısın?</h3><div class="@[512px]:max-w-[80%] body-600 text-pretty sm:body-700 text-content-white-secondary"><span class="[&amp;_*]:[word-break:break-word] [&amp;_*[id]]:scroll-mt-20 [&amp;_a[href]]:text-current [&amp;_a[href]]:underline [&amp;_a:not([href])]:!no-underline [&amp;_b]:font-500 [&amp;_strong]:font-500 [&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_code]:break-all [&amp;_p_code]:inline-block [&amp;_p_code]:rounded-400 [&amp;_p_code]:bg-background-subdued [&amp;_p_code]:px-1.5 [&amp;_p_code]:align-middle [&amp;_p_code]:text-600 [&amp;_p_code]:font-500 [&amp;_p_code]:before:[content:&#39;&#39;] [&amp;_p_code]:after:[content:&#39;&#39;] [&amp;_blockquote]:[quotes:none] [&amp;_blockquote_p]:before:[content:&#39;&#39;] [&amp;_blockquote_p]:after:[content:&#39;&#39;] [&amp;_ul]:mt-3 [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:pl-4 [&amp;_.inline-next-element+*]:inline [&amp;_li_+_li]:pt-2 [&amp;&gt;div&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0"><div><p>Entegrasyonu etkinleştirmek ve YZ Arka Planlar'ı doğrudan Pixelz'de denemek için bir Photoroom hesabı oluştur, 10 ücretsiz görsel kredisi kazan.</p></div></span></div><div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3 sm:mt-10 lg:mt-12"><a aria-busy="false" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-amp-default-track="true" data-amp-button-name="Start free trial" data-amp-button-position="Footer action block" data-translation-key="2a2da0d3-6e73-480b-8c5d-39b98a45c2c8" class="relative shrink-0 appearance-none overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center gap-[7px] rounded-500 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:misc-border-size-focus-ring transition-colors interaction-transition pl-[19px] pr-[15px] size-h-600 bg-background-white hover:bg-background-white-hover focus-visible:bg-background-white-hover active:bg-background-white-down text-content-black-primary focus-visible:ring-misc-white-focus-indicator cursor-pointer" href="https://app.photoroom.com/"><span class="max-w-full truncate component-500">Ücretsiz denemeye başla</span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" style="flex-shrink:0" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 text-current icon-size-400"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M11.2929 4.29289C11.6834 3.90237 12.3166 3.90237 12.7071 4.29289L19.7071 11.2929C20.0976 11.6834 20.0976 12.3166 19.7071 12.7071L12.7071 19.7071C12.3166 20.0976 11.6834 20.0976 11.2929 19.7071C10.9024 19.3166 10.9024 18.6834 11.2929 18.2929L16.5858 13H5C4.44772 13 4 12.5523 4 12C4 11.4477 4.44772 11 5 11H16.5858L11.2929 5.70711C10.9024 5.31658 10.9024 4.68342 11.2929 4.29289Z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></a><a class="relative inline-flex w-fit max-w-full appearance-none items-center justify-center overflow-hidden truncate text-center outline-none transition-all duration-200 focus-visible:misc-border-size-focus-ring disabled:pointer-events-none disable